Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; RemapUSB (prototype 2a): turns the Menu key (Apps, scancode E0 5D) into F24 (scancode 76) on every keyboard.
; With RemapUSB running, F24 from the remote triggers the action and F24 from other keyboards goes back to Menu.
; WARNING: replaces any existing Scancode Map. Takes effect after restarting Windows.
; The app does this itself in Settings, keeping other entries; this file is only for the prototype.

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Control\Keyboard Layout]
"Scancode Map"=hex:00,00,00,00,00,00,00,00,02,00,00,00,76,00,5d,e0,00,00,00,00
